WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:19.269 align:start position:0%
 
um  the last 10 days of my scooter odyssey  have arrived but dark clouds are  gathering on the horizon  i hope that's not a bad omen for the  rest of the trip  the head wind i'm facing certainly makes  every kilometer a real challenge  on my tour of germany i've arrived in  the state of baden-wurttemberg after 71  days in  2144 kilometers i reached schumberg  i started out two and a half months ago  at germany's northern tip  now i have nine days at the most to  reach my destination  schoenberg supposedly is a village of  beards what is that  i asked the residents why it's called  the village of beards i get the general  idea  because there's a beard club and it's  successful because they're world beard  champions and have special long twisted  beards much better than my five o'clock  shadow okay  i think i'd better take a look  so i make my way to the supposedly  amazing beard and mustache club which  claims to be the world's most successful  no wonder with current world title  holders in five different categories  this is how they look  and this is club chairman marcus bross  what's the attraction of wearing a beard  the attraction is that you like it  yourself people around you like it  and that you stand out in the crowd  women like them and why not  those are good arguments  how do you become world champion  easy you present yourself as a candidate  there are 17 different categories you  get assigned to a category and then you  have to stand on a catwalk and there are  seven judges and they say who has the  best beard  is there a fan culture in this beard  scene groupies and stuff like that  yes of course  mainly women over 50 and our wives and  girlfriends they like beards  in the light of this great enthusiasm  for beards these are my top three  third place is ghetto geiger with this  magnificent specimen in the chinese  category twice european champion  second place reinhardt burka with his  musketeer mustache  he's a world olympic and even super  beard  but the winner is france pill with these  stupendous whiskers  three times world champion seven times  european champion and six times german  champion  it's amazing how many different things  there are clubs for in germany there are  more than six hundred thousand clubs  statistically every german belongs to at  least one all you need in germany to  found a club is seven like-minded people  the things that exist in germany are  incredible but now i'd like to find out  how successful i will be with different  beards among the ladies  with the full gray beard i get an  immediate rejection  i don't want an artificial rose  with these glorious curls i  automatically hand over the rose more  self-confidently and it works this lady  agrees to drink a cup of coffee with me  a comment  with this mustache everything goes wrong  beards do seem to be advantageous in  real life 33 more dating success isn't a  bad result  with nothing more than my own  non-designer stubble i scoot further  south towards the black forest don't  worry i'm not giving up

